{"id":2125,"level":79,"name":"Майстерня зв’язок (1)","group":"Опануй зв’язку","format":27,"description":"<p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>You already learned the pin party in the black level. The pin is an incredibly strong weapon because the pinned piece loses a lot of power. With the pin party, you take advantage of that. A pinned piece cannot perform its defensive tasks properly, allowing you to capture a piece that is seemingly protected.&nbsp;</span></p>  <p></p>  <p><b>What do you have to do?&nbsp;</b></p>  <p><span style='font-weight: 400;'>Win material with the help of a pin. The pinned piece cannot perform the defensive task properly.&nbsp;</span></p>","assignment":"","stickerID":91,"examples":[{"fen":"r1br2k1/pp2ppbp/6p1/4N3/3P4/4B2P/P2KBPP1/R6R b - - 0 15","pgn":"15... Bxe5 * ","text":"<p>Чорна тура та білий король знаходяться на одній лінії. Чорні можуть скористатися цим за допомогою <strong>1...Bxe5!</strong> Через зв’язку білі не можуть повернути слона.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"8/2kb2pp/2p2p2/p3p3/3bP3/1B4B1/Pr3PPP/3R1K2 w - - 0 23","pgn":"23. Rxd4 * ","text":"<p>слон на d4 виглядає добре захищеним, але зовнішній вигляд оманливий. З <strong>1.Rxd4!</strong> Білі виграють матеріал.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"rnb1kb1r/pp2pppp/2pp1n2/q7/3PPP2/2N5/PPP1B1PP/R1BQK1NR b KQkq - 0 5","pgn":"5... Nxe4 {[%csl Ga5,Rc3,Re1,Ge4][%cal Ga5e1,Rc3e4]} * ","text":"","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":78250,"fen":"r1bq1rk1/1p1nbppp/2pp1n2/p3p3/1PP5/P1NP1NP1/4PPBP/R1BQ1RK1 b - - 0 9","pgn":"{[%csl Ra1,Ra3][%evp 0,1,-131,-153]} {Q=1} 9... axb4 * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":78262,"fen":"6r1/p3q1k1/1p2P1pp/3P1r2/2P5/1P5Q/P6P/6RK w - - 0 39","pgn":"{[%csl Rg6,Rg7][%evp 0,1,387,397]} {Q=1} 39. Qxf5 * ","format":27,"texts":["Зв’язані пішаки погано захищаються."],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":80559,"fen":"r3k2r/1pqn1ppp/p2bp3/3n4/8/3P2P1/PPP2PBP/R1BQR1K1 w kq - 0 13","pgn":"{[%csl Re6][%